"includes the complete UI, reset, and theme styles in the named <1/> cascade "
"layer. Component imports do not load another copy of the stylesheet, and "
"neither does importing it yourself."

#: docs/app/content/guide/troubleshooting.mdx
msgid ""
"Ardo loads its own stylesheet for every site. If your own styles don't apply, "
"check that <0/> imports your CSS file, and see <1>Stylesheet ownership and "
"cascade</1> for how Ardo's <2/> cascade layer interacts with yours."
msgstr ""
